:26},{"text":"아이들은","x":1111,"y":2258,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"사촌끼리","x":1260,"y":2258,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"매주","x":1412,"y":2258,"width":71,"height":37}]},{"text":"편지를 쓰고, 편지는 따로따로 봉투에 넣어서 일반 우편 서비스로 배달된다. 그러므로","words":[{"text":"편지를","x":187,"y":2314,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"쓰고,","x":303,"y":2317,"width":77,"height":35},{"text":"편지는","x":397,"y":2314,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"따로따로","x":510,"y":2314,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"봉투에","x":652,"y":2315,"width":95,"height":39},{"text":"넣어서","x":764,"y":2316,"width":91,"height":38},{"text":"일반","x":875,"y":2318,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"우편","x":950,"y":2318,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"서비스로","x":1031,"y":2318,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"배달된다.","x":1182,"y":2318,"width":143,"height":38},{"text":"그러므로","x":1341,"y":2317,"width":141,"height":38}]},{"text":"각각의 집에서 서로 다른 집으로 144통의 편지를 보낸다(전자메일을 이용했다면 많은","words":[{"text":"각각의","x":187,"y":2374,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"집에서","x":305,"y":2375,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"서로","x":420,"y":2375,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"다른","x":499,"y":2375,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"집으로","x":578,"y":2375,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"144통의","x":690,"y":2377,"width":113,"height":37},{"text":"편지를","x":820,"y":2377,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"보낸다(전자메일을","x":928,"y":2378,"width":283,"height":39},{"text":"이용했다면","x":1225,"y":2377,"width":172,"height":38},{"text":"많은","x":1411,"y":2377,"width":72,"height":37}]},{"text":"돈을 절약했을 것이다). 두 집안에는 우편을 수거하고 나눠 주는 한 명의 아이가 있는","words":[{"text":"돈을","x":187,"y":2435,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"절약했을","x":272,"y":2435,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"것이다).","x":425,"y":2435,"width":116,"height":40},{"text":"두","x":557,"y":2437,"width":32,"height":36},{"text":"집안에는","x":603,"y":2435,"width":129,"height":39},{"text":"우편을","x":744,"y":2437,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"수거하고","x":852,"y":2438,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"나눠","x":998,"y":2438,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"주는","x":1077,"y":2440,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"한","x":1160,"y":2438,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"명의","x":1211,"y":2437,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"아이가","x":1294,"y":2436,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"있는","x":1414,"y":2437,"width":69,"height":37}]},{"text":"데, 서부 집안은 “앤”이, 동부 집안은 “빌”이 담당한다. 매주 앤은 그녀의 모든 형제자","words":[{"text":"데,","x":189,"y":2495,"width":40,"height":38},{"text":"서부","x":247,"y":2495,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"집안은","x":332,"y":2496,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"“앤”이,","x":448,"y":2496,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"동부","x":563,"y":2497,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"집안은","x":643,"y":2496,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"“빌”이","x":751,"y":2496,"width":86,"height":38},{"text":"담당한다.","x":854,"y":2497,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"매주","x":1009,"y":2498,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"앤은","x":1091,"y":2498,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"그녀의","x":1173,"y":2497,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"모든","x":1292,"y":2497,"width":70,"height":35},{"text":"형제자","x":1377,"y":2496,"width":106,"height":39}]},{"text":"매에게서 우편물을 수거하고, 매일 집에 찾아오는 집배원에게 우편물을 준다. 편지가","words":[{"text":"매에게서","x":189,"y":2556,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"우편물을","x":340,"y":2557,"width":138,"height":36},{"text":"수거하고,","x":491,"y":2557,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"매일","x":646,"y":2557,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"집에","x":725,"y":2556,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"찾아오는","x":802,"y":2556,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"집배원에게","x":946,"y":2557,"width":163,"height":37},{"text":"우편물을","x":1128,"y":2557,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"준다.","x":1280,"y":2556,"width":79,"height":37},{"text":"편지가","x":1378,"y":2556,"width":104,"height":38}]}]}